	DisplayName: Tlipoca's Headband
	Tooltip: Increases melee damage by {0}%
	SetBonus:
		'''
		+2 HP/s health regeneration rate
		Increases melee damage by {0}%, melee critical strike chance by {1}%
		Increases critical strike damage by {2}%, defense by {3}
		While holding [i:YogsothothsYardMod/CrimsonScythe]Tlipoca's Scythe:
		Press the Ability key to harvest the health of enemies you hit
		The health harvested is determined by the enemy's current health and the scythe's Slaughter Progress
		The more health harvested, the longer the cooldown of this ability
		Maximum harvest is 5% of the enemy's current health
		'''
}

